{{!--
    Render the synopsis for a preprocessor macro.

    The synopsis is the `#define` signature reconstructed from
    the macro's name and, for function-like macros, its parameter
    list. The macro body is deliberately not shown: like every
    other symbol, the synopsis presents the interface (name and
    parameters), not the implementation.

    Expected Context: {Symbol Object} (kind == "macro")
--}}
#define {{name}}{{#if isFunctionLike}}({{#each parameters}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}{{#if isVariadic}}{{#if parameters}}, {{/if}}...{{/if}}){{/if}}
